825_1900701226084517479_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=Mzk5OTA3NDIwMTQ1NjE5ODYyOA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=AtaQkCmltskQ7kNvwGQ-KzI&_nc_oc=AdrrTahJm_4Uu49ArQh9U78xI2pz9HUhVP3fiy8clHEbdSDlzruDV5YN_AkcWy28x8g&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=ITRi7zpqFEwctk7x43hZcA&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQSwIsn4KXIFTaxBwRuuSpZCU6yVNzH6likdD4vFkbE5kw&oe=6AE890AC", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "id": "12", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "adashti247", "author_id": "2247392340", "id": "18062271599530428", "text": "it is 2.5", "timestamp": 1792316134, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kiotchirou", "author_id": "44036919977", "id": "18116105866824823", "text": "you mean 2.5D?", "timestamp": 1791456510, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "davidmnry88", "author_id": "256349273", "id": "17902658307667447", "text": "That's 2.5d", "timestamp": 1791101963, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "94hectorflopa", "author_id": "495743535", "id": "17989559282862325", "text": "Dude, this is 3d, even though you used flat 2d assets... Not that you projected everything with the angle from the camera...", "timestamp": 1791056596, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "sahak.kasapyan.02", "author_id": "8726960861", "id": "18136711798724321", "text": "so 2.5d indeed", "timestamp": 1791027061, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "stone_of_arts18", "author_id": "7013911486", "id": "18014944181950232", "text": "Im still confused how you got such low fps, are you using instancing? A few faces shouldnt really give the engine any problems, and 13ms sounds like a lot", "timestamp": 1791026732, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "marcelslofstra", "author_id": "69067434727", "id": "18416020216154639", "text": "Ehm, Thats not true 2d. You\u2019re literally tilting a camera. Around an axis that doesn\u2019t exist in 2d.", "timestamp": 1791015371, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "mkb_sagemode", "author_id": "35291061789", "id": "17946268968345984", "text": "Serious Question: when you tilted the camera to see the horizon I see signs of 3d perspective rendering on the front and sides of the lifted terrain? So... Are we using nothing but 2d sprites for everything or just trees and characters? This rendering style gives paper Mario vibes", "timestamp": 1791006603, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "paulimriss", "author_id": "1751196553", "id": "17905534182588141", "text": "every 3D game are just 2D transforms", "timestamp": 1791001594, "like_count": 14}, {"author": "grandmasterglick", "author_id": "1238752403", "id": "18184529371419073", "text": "But it is 3D though", "timestamp": 1790994317, "like_count": 8}, {"author": "marx_rd.mp4", "author_id": "52515679639", "id": "17982890910106115", "text": "I remember doing ROM hacks before and I use those numbers for special tile behavior", "timestamp": 1790988399, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chlowoeee", "author_id": "61900548477", "id": "17887221402685516", "text": "The AI voice is terrible", "timestamp": 1790983267, "like_count": 39}, {"author": "eneseryiilmaz", "author_id": "5714262124", "id": "18124707458309998", "text": "well done bro but 13 ms still bit concerning", "timestamp": 1790966421, "like_count": 2}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dd_kMxYOcPk/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dd_kMxYOcPk/", "webpage_url_basename": "Dd_kMxYOcPk", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/833388086_18095185961208825_1900701226084517479_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=Mzk5OTA3NDIwMTQ1NjE5ODYyOA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=AtaQkCmltskQ7kNvwGQ-KzI&_nc_oc=AdrrTahJm_4Uu49ArQh9U78xI2pz9H